	$copy mbannn: file.name
and
	$copy file.name mbannn:

In many cases you'll know a logical name for the mailbox instead of the unit 
number:

	$copy mb-log-name: file.name
and
	$copy file.name mb-log-name:

OBTW, $copy mbannn: nl: is a great way to relieve RWMBX.

