Organization: All USENET -- http://www.Supernews.com
Newsgroups: comp.os.vms,comp.sys.vms


Have DECnet-OSI V6.2 on several VAX nodes running OpenVMS V6.2.  Have
applications that talk to one another across nodes via DECnet.  For some
reason (ever since DECnet-OSI was installed) we have been experiencing
problems where user's proxies nolonger work.

Some cases these proxies were gone and had to be added back again.  
UAF> ADD/PROXY LOCAL:.node::user user /DEFAULT

Other cases the proxies were there but could not be shown individually.

UAF> SHOW /PROXY *   ! Lists proxy in question as well as all others

UAF> SHOW /PROXY node::user  ! Proxy in question does not show

Should I re-create the netproxy file with LOCAL:. as the prefix for the
remote nodes?

Anyone else experiencing this problem?



